WEBVTT

00:10:58.479 --> 00:11:03.628
(Applause)

00:11:05.056 --> 00:11:07.234
Now, as you can imagine,

00:11:08.131 --> 00:11:11.768
law enforcement officials
don't love these recommendations.

00:11:11.792 --> 00:11:13.300
(Laughter)

00:11:13.324 --> 00:11:15.764
They stand to lose a lot of money,

00:11:15.788 --> 00:11:20.615
and they believe civil forfeiture
is an effective crime-fighting tool.

00:11:21.135 --> 00:11:22.616
The trouble is,

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:23.838
it's not.

00:11:24.765 --> 00:11:27.129
In June 2019, we released a study

00:11:27.153 --> 00:11:31.367
that found forfeiture does not
improve crime-fighting.